<title>USA: WEEKLY BROILER/EGG REPORT -- USDA.</title>
<headline>WEEKLY BROILER/EGG REPORT -- USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Placements of broiler chicks in the 15 major producing states in the week ended Aug 2 totalled 137.514 million, versus a revised 137.084 million in the previous week and 134.314 million a year ago, the U.S. Agriculture Department said.</p>
<p>Eggs set in those states in the same week totalled 169.669 million, versus a revised 171.338 million the previous week and 167.017 million in the comparable week of last year, USDA said.</p>
